      ],
      "explanation": "\\(5x=80\\), \\(x=16\\).",
      "id": "cross-products",
      "sourceRef": "cn-math/cnm_p211_q2#cross-products",
      "title": "Use cross-products"
    },
    {
      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_p107"
      ],
      "explanation": "Multiplying both terms of a ratio by the same nonzero number leaves its quotient unchanged. Since \\(20=5\\times4\\), multiply both terms of \\(4:5\\) by \\(4\\):\n\\[\n4:5=(4\\times4):(5\\times4)=16:20.\n\\]\nTherefore \\(x=16\\).",
      "id": "equivalent-ratio-scaling",
